From c102fd8188425ead6fa843a5e52900bfdb2a3824 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 03:27:21 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Compare only against a prior period that is fully loaded

While the previous period was still importing (or when it could not be
imported), the few hours of data that spill past the start of the selected
range were treated as the whole prior period, so tiles showed changes like
+145050%. Each dataset now records where its imported period starts, and a
comparison is made only when that covers the whole prior window; otherwise
the tile says 'no prior data'.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
